Regional link shows rising packet loss during peak hours. This is causing disruptions to customer services.

Evidence Needed

To provide a comprehensive analysis, the following information would be required:

–  Time-series data on packet loss rates
–  Network topology diagram
–  Device configuration details (e.g., routing tables, firewall rules)
–  Performance monitoring metrics (e.g., latency, throughput)

Likely Causes

